<div class="blog-narrow">
  <h1 class="blog-page-title">所有标签</h1>
  <p class="blog-lead">按字母顺序排列；点选可查看同标签文章（含 blog 阅读上下文链接）。</p>
  <ul class="blog-tags-list" role="list">
    {% for tag in collections.blogTags %}
      <li class="blog-tags-list__item">
        <a href="/blog/tags/{{ tag | blogTagSlug }}/">#{{ tag }}</a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
